          <td style="padding: 8px 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; width: 250px; font-size: 13px;">
            <div>लिंक असलेले बँक नाव</div>
            <div style="font-size: 10.5px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 500;">(bank_name)</div>
          </td>
